PART 4: FREQUENCY RESPONSE
======================================================================
Frequency response of the stable comparison filter:
  Peak frequency: 2.1628 rad = 0.6884π
  Peak magnitude: 12.94 dB
  arg(λ_c) = 2.1762 rad = 0.6927π
  π·ln(2) = 2.1776 rad = 0.6931π

  *** The filter peaks at ω ≈ arg(λ_c) ≈ π·ln(2) ***
  *** This is the INFORMATION FREQUENCY: 1 bit per π radians ***

